WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:33.430
His Majesty, the King, has--

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:35.580
your father...

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:37.920
has passed away.

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:40.200
But what... so suddenly...

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:44.160
Contact Quinza! I'm going home immediately!

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:47.470
You can't go home.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:52.280
You have been exiled for treason.

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:54.640
Your Highness...

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:57.140
if you insist on returning, you will likely be imprisoned.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:01:59.790
Fool...

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:06.030
That... that's not true!

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:11.070
"Country of the Sun"

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.780
The Raginei Royal Palace has announced the capture of several officers...

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:20.660
accused, along with second-in-line Prince Rumaty, of planning a coup d'etat...

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.780
and the assassination of the Crown Prince.

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:26.050
Their executions have reportedly already taken place.

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.840
Attention has focused, meanwhile, on Prince Rumaty...

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:34.980
who is believed to be in the US, but whose whereabouts are unknown.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:37.460
There has been no statement from him at this time.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:41.270
If he saw this, Prince Rumaty would be pretty upset...

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.740
not only that, we left without saying anything...

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:46.370
Lee-Leng will be able to explain it to him.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:49.040
That's why he stayed behind for me.

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:52.450
Looks like the American government will recognize his refugee status.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.930
Yeah, I think Dad was able to use his influence.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:03:00.390
But then, His Highness would probably say he isn't a refugee at all...

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.070
At any rate, as soon as we land, we'll go see Crown Prince Somand...

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:07.200
or, if that's impossible, Quinza.

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:09.480
I want to find out the truth.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.530
Right. But...

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.680
this really sucks.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.270
A big brother setting up his little brother like this...

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:20.740
Wait there, Rumaty.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.340
I will make sure you can come back to your country.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.060
Raginei...

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:31.800
Country of the sun.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.590
Why? Why didn't someone tell me?

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.840
If we'd told you Kajika was going to Raginei...

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.820
you would have said you were going, too, wouldn't you?

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.850
Of course! How many times have I said I want to go home?

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:53.010
There's your answer. Please calm down.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:55.950
Bring some tea.

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:57.420
Certainly, sir.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:03.870
Burnsworth's influence extends to the media...

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:07.340
Which means even if they get wind of it...

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.590
they won't announce Your Highness' location.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.380
And I'm sure Quinza will never reveal it.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.040
In other words, as long as you stay here, Your Highness, you'll be safe.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:19.930
So what?

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.940
You want me to hide until they say I've abandoned my country?

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:26.570
If you go back now...

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:29.140
even more blood will be shed.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:31.480
Don't you understand that?

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.660
It's a matter of waiting for the situation to calm down.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.560
There's plenty of time to plan a way out of this.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:44.530
That's why Kajika's going to Raginei, to search for clues.

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:47.720
Aren't you concerned about letting Kajika go?

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:52.090
She's going as a representative of Harry, the Chairman.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:54.550
But in that case, it's even more dangerous!

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.100
She's the only daughter of the Burnsworth family.

00:04:57.820 --> 00:04:59.550
Is it really worth using her?

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.360
Prince...

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:05.530
you can't think of Burnsworth as an ordinary multinational.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:11.080
You know the current aide to the President?

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:14.710
He's a friend of Harry's from college.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:19.010
It was Harry's support that got him into the White House.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.970
In other words...

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:25.760
if Harry's angry, America's angry.

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:29.430
There's no way Raginei can lay a hand on Kajika.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:34.850
Here you are.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.800
Your impatience won't do any good.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:39.620
This isn't a vacation, though...

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.490
it's good study time.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:45.680
Enough.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.110
Ah, sorry...

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:53.480
How long is he going to act like that?

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:57.400
This is a perfect opportunity for him to learn patience.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.580
But now, what about Quinza?

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.960
The private plane is still in England...

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:06.730
but it seems that was a diversion...

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.570
while he himself returned to Raginei.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.770
Because he knew this would happen...?

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.040
And Raginei?

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:19.250
The Royal Palace has instituted a communications blackout.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:23.760
Even ascertaining Miss Kajika's arrival through the Ministry of Foreign Affairs has been difficult...

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:25.520
I'm sorry to say.

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.450
I see.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:31.290
However, the internal report on Raginei is ready.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:33.490
Would you care to see it?

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.030
I'll take a look.

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:40.880
The father of Raginei's modernization...

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.320
the 73rd King, Machaty Sheik.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.740
This is his wedding picture.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.600
I see... Rumaty's spitting image.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:54.670
It is the duty of the King of Raginei to take two wives.

00:06:56.490 --> 00:07:00.250
With his first wife, Arena, Machaty had two sons.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.720
With his second wife, Sereira, he had one daughter.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.220
The son he had with Arena...

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.420
was the 74th King, Woold.

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.770
On his death, his eldest son Somand...

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.960
becomes the 75th King.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:18.790
However, if anything should happen to Somand...

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.730
Rumaty is second in line.

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:23.090
Isn't that so.

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:24.770
Right.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:28.820
So Somand, born with a weak constitution, in accordance with ancient tradition...

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.780
has never set foot outside the palace.

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:38.280
On the other hand, second son Rumaty, Machaty's spitting image...

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:41.400
with the blue eyes of the founder, King Samaness...

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:43.540
with his cheerfulness and generosity...

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:47.010
has all the love of the people.

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:56.690
Like light and shadow...

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.830
And then, to make matters more complicated...

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:03.670
Raginei has a peculiar system of succession.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:06.090
If the King's reign lasts longer than 5 years...

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:08.640
his siblings and cousins lose all right to the throne...

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.890
and it passes on to the next generation.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:15.200
In other words, after Somand is crowned...

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:20.830
once 5 years pass, second-in-line Rumaty, third-in-line Izmal and fourth-in-line Najayra...

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.650
will all lose their rights of succession.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:23.930
Right.

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.810
A contest of succession with a time limit...

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.010
and the starter pistol has already gone off...

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:32.880
What shall we do?

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.680
Somehow Quinza is caught in all this, after all.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.070
He knew about this plot...

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:40.140
so why didn't he stop it?

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.150
No matter how I look at it, it's suspicious.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:44.760
Tell Toranosuke...

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:47.440
give it three days, then make sure to bring Kajika back.

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:50.150
Yes, sir.

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:59.700
I wonder... exactly how many people know...

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:03.040
Harry is Machaty's first-born child.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:08.240
His right of succession ended 5 years after Woold took the throne...

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:12.000
but, as his child, Kajika's right remains...

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:14.320
and what's more...

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:16.010
his first-born daughter...

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:18.400
would be first in line for the throne.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:21.010
The crown isn't Somand's...

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:25.060
it's hers.

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:31.430
Just as I thought... I should never have let her go.

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:34.610
Master Quinza.

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:36.400
Master Quinza.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.310
Master Quinza...

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:41.460
Hmph. What a revolting sight.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:46.910
The Crown Prince ignores you, Master Kanan, his Grand Chamberlain, and asks for Quinza...

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.620
Because we kept Prince Rumaty away from Prince Somand...

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:54.620
we led them into conflict.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.530
But the timid Prince became so afraid of Master Rumaty...

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:02.070
that he keeps even other people at a distance.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:05.610
Lately it's so bad that, outside of Quinza...

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:07.740
he says he won't see anyone at all.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:11.020
Well, so be it. It doesn't matter what he does.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.020
The problem is with Master Rumaty.

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:17.550
But... with him exiled for the charge of assassination...

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:20.320
who on earth could form such a scheme...

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:23.060
I don't know. But...

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:25.060
it's Master Rumaty's temperament.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:28.830
We can't be sure he doesn't know about our own schemes...

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:30.450
But then -- certainly...

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.130
We have to nip this catastrophe in the bud.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.740
Your Highness, he's here.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:39.990
It's Master Quinza.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:43.130
Is it really Quinza?

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.460
Your voice... let me hear your voice!

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:47.650
Please open up.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.110
Enter!

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:57.590
Ah, Master Quinza...

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.790
My Lord.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.710
Come closer. Hurry!

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:19.100
Rumaty? Have you found Rumaty?

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.090
No.

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:25.050
But he can never set foot in Raginei again.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:26.740
But he lives!

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:29.210
Rumaty will come back.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.130
He'll come, back and he'll kill me.

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:35.820
Why did I ever think exile would be enough?

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.530
You're frightened.

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:40.030
Of course!

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:43.050
I've executed innocent people...

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:45.500
and charged my brother with an unthinkable crime.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:48.940
Rumaty will never forgive me...

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.520
Try to put it out of your mind.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:55.120
I am the one who gave the execution order.

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:58.080
You bear none of the guilt.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.040
Quinza...

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:03.050
And after serving him for so long...

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.700
I was also the one who set Prince Rumaty up.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.000
I was ashamed, but...

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:11.560
I would do anything for the royal house, with no regrets.

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:13.570
But...

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:16.020
You are going to become His Majesty the King.

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:19.520
There will be some obstacles you must overcome.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:22.070
Ob--obstacles?

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:26.050
Flatterers who try to get close to His Majesty...

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:28.790
people who chase after the throne like wild dogs...

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:31.850
They're still out there? People like that?

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:34.650
Unfortunately. However...

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.790
They're no threat to His Majesty...

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.840
because he is the representative of Raginei's God.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:42.620
God...

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:45.090
That's right.

00:12:45.900 --> 00:12:47.840
His Majesty holds the power.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:50.360
None may oppose him.

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:52.870
God?

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:56.500
Listening to you gives me strength...

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.040
Tell me! What should I do?

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:03.640
Strengthen the Royal Guard.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:07.880
Instead of mere decoration, make them a real army under your direct control...

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:13.200
an organization that uncovers and annihilates all disruptive elements.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:16.860
I--I understand. Do whatever you want.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.720
More people protecting me is a good thing...

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:23.130
Leave it to me.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:25.610
I will show you the destruction...

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:28.740
of everyone who stands against you.

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.370
What magnificent contrast...

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:32.610
Huh?

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:34.350
In this garden...

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:37.000
the harsh sunlight of Raginei...

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:38.370
produces such light and shadow.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:42.370
It's easy to understand why they worship the sun.

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:51.460
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:54.290
I am the Crown Prince's Grand Chamberlain, Hobel Kanan.

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.740
Young Master...

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:01.370
I'm Carl Rosenthal.

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:04.130
I'm here on behalf of my father, Nelson.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:14.070
Of course, Mr. Rosenthal is a giant in the financial world...

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:16.900
and now he's sent us his young son...

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:18.810
I am a novice...

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:22.450
but I'm useful enough for running errands.

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:24.960
No! That's--we didn't mean...

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:32.000
First of all, my deepest condolences on the recent death of His Majesty the King.

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:37.350
Still, the end of one era is also the beginning of another.

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:39.790
Thank you.

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:41.800
However...

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:45.540
there's still a small problem in our way...

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.690
Prince Rumaty, you mean?

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:49.730
Right.

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:53.380
Anyone who would commit such a crime, even a brother...

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:58.540
naturally, we must summon him back to stand trial, or justice will not be served.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:01.280
But...

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:05.000
inside America's borders, in order to find him...

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:09.050
I see.  You're seeking... cooperation...

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.310
Just as you say.

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:18.340
From what I could see from the plane...

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:21.820
Construction on your new oil refinery is going well.

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:25.420
Ah, yes, thank you.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:30.010
The Burnsworth corporate logo stands out, as always...

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:32.160
As for that...

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:35.790
Burnsworth has monopolized oil development in Raginei...

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:36.920
for 25 years.

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:41.700
It's more than a partnership now...

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.730
Wherever Prince Rumaty is...

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:48.190
I say Mr. Burnsworth is deeply concerned in it.

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:51.480
That information has never been confirmed...

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:54.440
It's nothing to worry about.

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:59.060
If Prince Somand were to discover that Burnsworth sided with Rumaty...

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.100
he'd be prepared to cut all ties.

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.940
Raginei is changing.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:11.010
It's time to sever old bonds, and go forward with new partners to meet the new era.

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:18.270
I'll tell my father.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:25.820
Was that alright?

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:28.800
Saying all that without Prince Somand's permission...

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:33.020
Without a reward, a dog won't hunt.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:36.850
What does it matter, until Rumaty is found?

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:38.140
Master Kanan...

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:43.460
Burnsworth isn't going to openly support Rumaty.

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:46.710
After we have the Prince...

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:50.440
we just have to tell Rosenthal there was no reason to cut ties.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:52.380
I see.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:55.680
There's a sly old fox in the Royal Palace of the Sun...

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:58.970
If the King is taken in by those idiots...

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:00.980
it doesn't say much for him.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.260
Well, certainly.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:04.730
As planned...

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:08.530
Somand and Rumaty will do us the favor of fighting furiously over the throne.

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:11.250
And you'll encourage the brothers' quarrel...

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.730
Mm-hmm. If the two of them destroy each other...

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:17.990
the throne goes to someone we already have in our hands...

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:19.840
third-in-succession Izmal.

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:22.580
That would only help us.

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:24.610
The fall of Rosenthal...

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:27.230
began 25 years ago on this soil.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:32.680
For my father's sake... I'll carve a foothold here for our restoration.

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:35.710
War, then...

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:38.420
Yes. This is war.

00:17:39.050 --> 00:17:40.860
Raginei will be the setting...

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:44.030
for the war between Rosenthal and Burnsworth.

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:52.040
Wow...

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.300
It took me by surprise...

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:56.560
a modern city like this.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:17:59.450
Well, then.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:01.050
Where are you going?

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:02.460
Be right back.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.600
Master Quinza...

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:23.520
how long is he going to keep praying?

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:26.260
He's been like that for two hours now.

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:36.670
Ah--Master Quinza!

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:41.210
Ioe? I don't like being spied on.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:43.190
I'm sorry.

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:47.060
However... there's something I want to ask you.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:53.030
I just can't believe it.

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:56.230
All this about Prince Rumaty plotting a coup.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.480
It's no use.

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:02.020
There are written confessions from the officers that were arrested.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.230
They can't be ignored.

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:07.880
But then, no one's sure just where they were written.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:11.540
Then--you have doubts, too, after all!

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:14.360
Shh. Lower your voice.

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:17.300
The walls have ears.

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:20.970
If someone close to Prince Somand heard that, even that would be unforgivable.

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.240
I apologize...

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.340
Be mindful, Ioe.

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:27.860
Right now, Prince Somand's mind...

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:29.750
is filled with suspicion.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.290
He takes every word seriously...

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:35.360
and he'll mercilessly punish anyone who has doubts.

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:36.990
But that...

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:40.920
From now on, you can't speak carelessly in this country.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:44.650
Isn't that a dictatorship, ruling through fear?

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:46.600
Of course.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:49.210
I'm going to try and keep that from happening.

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:50.700
However...

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:55.420
I'm under suspicion as well of having allowed Rumaty to escape to America.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:59.080
Who knows how long I will keep my position as Chamberlain...

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:01.700
Master Quinza...

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:07.680
For now, anyway, I'll serve Prince Somand...

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.580
and try to keep the country from going in the wrong direction.

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.710
I'll help, too.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:16.220
Until we can prove Prince Rumaty's innocence.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.270
--Ioe
--Ah?

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:23.670
While I'm grateful for your help...

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:27.630
I meant it when I asked you not to attract attention...

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.780
Right.

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:43.340
Master Quinza...

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.180
When you were praying before, were you, perhaps...

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.070
anxious for your country?

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:49.910
Mm. That's right.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:52.660
I made a heartfelt vow to God...

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:57.280
"Dear Lord... please protect my King...

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.020
and I'll..."

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:03.590
Ah, I'm bushed...

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:05.810
No good, even as Dad's representative?

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.460
No, it doesn't matter who...

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:12.000
you can't see Prince Somand. He won't talk to anyone.

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:13.680
And Quinza?

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:17.140
About that.... According to the Head Chamberlain...

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:21.140
he can't leave, because he's Chamberlain to Prince Somand.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:22.790
Somand?

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:25.490
Quinza is Rumaty's Chamberlain!

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:27.950
I--I know, but he definitely said...

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:30.000
Strange.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.400
Just as Lee-Leng said, something is going on here...

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:37.990
Mustafa!

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.580
Eugene!

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:43.290
Wh--why are you dressed like that?

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:48.330
If you can't get in the front door...

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:50.960
use the back door.

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:53.630
My father wrote me an invitation.

00:21:54.970 --> 00:21:57.150
I'm heading out to Prince Izmal's party.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:58.910
Izmal?

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:00.980
He's Prince Rumaty's cousin.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:05.390
Someone of my class should be able to meet him pretty easily.

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:08.930
Plus, he apparently has a weakness for Caucasians...

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:10.260
Really...

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:13.740
I see! In that case, you're the perfect man for the job.

00:22:14.420 --> 00:22:16.370
But... is it alright?

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:20.740
The other side already knows that Rumaty and I are connected.

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:25.290
If it's discovered that you and I are connected...

00:22:25.960 --> 00:22:27.820
It's too convenient.

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:30.050
If that does happen...

00:22:30.230 --> 00:22:32.520
they'll contact me on their own.

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:34.780
But...

00:22:38.650 --> 00:22:40.220
I'll be fine...

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:41.780
be good and wait for me...

00:22:43.990 --> 00:22:47.080
Besides, I'm actually quite excited...

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:51.980
setting out to captivate someone of my own free will.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:57.340
Mustafa...

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
